{
  "file": "Latent",
  "page": 33,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        51.5809440612793,
        508.62591552734375,
        82.56494140625
      ],
      "text": "4.\t Testing for latent tuberculosis infection",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        182.26649475097656,
        500.66656494140625,
        194.54049682617188
      ],
      "text": "Either a tuberculin skin test (TST) or interferon-gamma release assay (IGRA) can be used to test for",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        194.22695922851562,
        407.6747131347656,
        206.53897094726562
      ],
      "text": "New recommendation ) LTBI.  (Strong recommendation, very low-quality evidence.",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03570556640625,
        211.93495178222656,
        485.7572326660156,
        224.20895385742188
      ],
      "text": "Remark: The availability and affordability of the tests will determine which will be chosen by clinicians and",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03570556640625,
        223.9334259033203,
        485.90631103515625,
        236.20742797851562
      ],
      "text": "programme managers. Neither TST nor IGRA can be used to diagnose active TB disease nor for diagnostic",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03570556640625,
        235.93190002441406,
        264.1581726074219,
        248.20590209960938
      ],
      "text": "workup of adults suspected of having active TB.",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        253.6018829345703,
        480.29937744140625,
        265.8758850097656
      ],
      "text": "People living with HIV who have a positive test for LTBI benefit more from preventive treatment",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        265.600341796875,
        492.7282409667969,
        277.8743591308594
      ],
      "text": "than those who have a negative LTBI test; LTBI testing can be used, where feasible, to identify such",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        277.59881591796875,
        428.8671875,
        289.8728332519531
      ],
      "text": "individuals.  (Strong recommendation, high-quality evidence. Existing recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        295.268798828125,
        494.1636962890625,
        307.5428161621094
      ],
      "text": "LTBI testing by TST or IGRA is not a requirement for initiating preventive treatment in people living",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        307.26727294921875,
        477.59832763671875,
        319.5412902832031
      ],
      "text": "with HIV or child household contacts aged < 5 years.  (Strong recommendation, moderate-quality",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        319.2657470703125,
        236.53131103515625,
        331.5397644042969
      ],
      "text": "evidence. Updated recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        336.42120361328125,
        509.176025390625,
        347.9411926269531
      ],
      "text": "Source of existing recommendation: Guidelines for intensified tuberculosis case-finding and isoniazid preventive",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        347.419189453125,
        499.1456298828125,
        358.9391784667969
      ],
      "text": "therapy for people living with HIV in resource-constrained settings. Geneva; World Health Organization; 2011",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        358.41717529296875,
        397.2152099609375,
        369.9371643066406
      ],
      "text": "(http://apps.who.int/iris/bitstream/10665/44472/1/9789241500708_eng.pdf).",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        399.6023254394531,
        174.2017364501953,
        415.1063232421875
      ],
      "text": "Summary of evidence",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        418.4250183105469,
        526.6463623046875,
        431.2250061035156
      ],
      "text": "There is no gold standard method for diagnosing LTBI. TST and IGRA require a competent immune response in",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        432.4250183105469,
        525.244140625,
        445.2250061035156
      ],
      "text": "order to identify people infected with TB and are imperfect tests for measuring progression to active disease.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        452.09503173828125,
        526.6564331054688,
        464.89501953125
      ],
      "text": "A previous systematic review was updated to compare the predictive performance of IGRA and TST for",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        466.09503173828125,
        526.6381225585938,
        478.89501953125
      ],
      "text": "identifying incident active TB in countries with a high TB incidence  . Only studies in which TST was  (38)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        480.09503173828125,
        526.7081909179688,
        492.89501953125
      ],
      "text": "compared with IGRA in the same population (“head-to-head” studies) were included. Relative risk ratios for",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        494.09503173828125,
        526.71826171875,
        506.89501953125
      ],
      "text": "TB for people who tested positive and those who tested negative with TST and IGRA were estimated. The",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        325.8211364746094,
        508.0350341796875,
        395.47314453125,
        520.9650268554688
      ],
      "text": "Annexes 1 and 2",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        508.09503173828125,
        400.32611083984375,
        520.89501953125
      ],
      "text": "evidence-to-decision and the GRADE tables are presented in  .",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        527.7650146484375,
        526.67626953125,
        540.5650024414062
      ],
      "text": "Five prospective cohort studies were identified, with a total of 7769 participants; four were newly identified.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        541.7650146484375,
        526.68212890625,
        554.5650024414062
      ],
      "text": "Three of the studies were conducted in South Africa and two in India  . The studies included people  (18, 39–42)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        555.7650146484375,
        526.6912841796875,
        568.5650024414062
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV, pregnant women, adolescents, health care workers and household contacts. The pooled risk",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        569.7650146484375,
        526.606201171875,
        582.5650024414062
      ],
      "text": "ratio estimate for TST was 1.49 (95% CI, 0.79; 2.80), and that for IGRA was 2.03 (95% CI, 1.18; 3.50). Although",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        583.7650146484375,
        526.693359375,
        596.5650024414062
      ],
      "text": "the estimate for IGRA was slightly higher than that for TST, the 95% CIs for the estimates for TST and IGRA",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        597.7650146484375,
        526.6812133789062,
        610.5650024414062
      ],
      "text": "overlapped and were imprecise. Furthermore, there was limited evidence for the predictive utility of the tests",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        611.7650146484375,
        197.07305908203125,
        624.5650024414062
      ],
      "text": "in specific at-risk populations.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        639.783447265625,
        237.75367736816406,
        655.2874145507812
      ],
      "text": "Rationale for the recommendations",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        658.6061401367188,
        526.688232421875,
        671.4061279296875
      ],
      "text": "The evidence reviewed and the recommendations apply to the use of the two commercially available IGRAs",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        672.6061401367188,
        526.6182861328125,
        685.4061279296875
      ],
      "text": "(QuantiFERON®-TB Gold In-Tube and T-SPOT®.TB) only. The GDG concluded that the comparison of TST",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        686.6061401367188,
        526.6741943359375,
        699.4061279296875
      ],
      "text": "and IGRA in the same population does not provide strong evidence that one test should be preferred over the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        700.6061401367188,
        526.6632080078125,
        713.4061279296875
      ],
      "text": "other for predicting progression to active TB disease. The GDG noted that TST may require significantly fewer",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        714.6061401367188,
        526.7080688476562,
        727.4061279296875
      ],
      "text": "resources than IGRA and may be more familiar to practitioners in resource-constrained settings; however,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        728.6061401367188,
        526.6072387695312,
        741.4061279296875
      ],
      "text": "recurrent global shortages and stock-outs of TST reduce its use in scaling up programmatic management of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        742.6061401367188,
        93.61009979248047,
        755.4061279296875
      ],
      "text": "LTBI.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        538.5827026367188,
        790.2608032226562,
        552.8386840820312,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "21",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        356.8854064941406,
        796.524658203125,
        524.4114379882812,
        805.5686645507812
      ],
      "text": "4. TESTING FOR LATENT TUBERCULOSIS INFECTION",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}